1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:33,158 --> 00:00:35,452
[Lily] <i>So you two are</i>
<i>working together now?</i>

4
00:00:35,535 --> 00:00:37,787
<i>Is this a new form of torture?</i>

5
00:00:37,871 --> 00:00:40,498
[Helena] <i>I didn't take your</i>
<i>resignation very well.</i>

6
00:00:40,582 --> 00:00:41,708
-<i>Once you're in…</i>
-[crowd screaming]

7
00:00:41,791 --> 00:00:44,919
<i>…the only way out is death.</i>

8
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:47,297
[Julio] <i>I'll be sending you an address.</i>

9
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,675
<i>Once you receive it, you have to</i>
<i>be there within 20 minutes.</i>

10
00:00:50,759 --> 00:00:54,137
<i>Because if not,</i>
<i>your precious love will die.</i>

11
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:56,514
[goon] <i>Someone more powerful</i>
<i>wants to hire us.</i>

12
00:00:56,598 --> 00:00:59,434
<i>We already made a deal, and I and</i>
<i>my men will start working for her now.</i>

13
00:00:59,517 --> 00:01:01,394
<i>I'm sorry, Jaguar. It's just business.</i>

14
00:01:01,936 --> 00:01:02,854
<i>Nothing personal.</i>

15
00:01:02,937 --> 00:01:06,149
[Helena] <i>There's a gun hidden</i>
<i>somewhere in that warehouse.</i>

16
00:01:06,232 --> 00:01:10,653
<i>You have to end each other's life</i>

17
00:01:10,737 --> 00:01:12,655
<i>with a single bullet.</i>

18
00:01:12,739 --> 00:01:14,574
[Diego] <i>Damian! We're on the same side!</i>

19
00:01:14,657 --> 00:01:15,950
[Damian] <i>Say your prayers!</i>

20
00:01:16,451 --> 00:01:19,454
[Diego] <i>If you kill Lily,</i>
<i>how will Camia ever love you?</i>

21
00:01:20,205 --> 00:01:21,331
[Emilia] <i>That's it! Come on!</i>

22
00:01:21,414 --> 00:01:22,624
<i>Yeah!</i>

23
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,377
[Damian] <i>I've lost Camia</i>
<i>lots of times before!</i>

24
00:01:26,461 --> 00:01:27,921
<i>I won't let that happen again!</i>

25
00:01:28,004 --> 00:01:31,174
<i>In the end, it's us who will survive!</i>

26
00:01:31,257 --> 00:01:34,552
[somber music playing]

27
00:01:41,851 --> 00:01:44,562
[somber music continues playing]

28
00:01:48,942 --> 00:01:49,818
[Jepoy] Hello?

29
00:01:50,276 --> 00:01:52,028
Didn't you receive my messages?

30
00:01:53,154 --> 00:01:55,156
Yeah, I really need backup!

31
00:01:57,951 --> 00:01:59,077
Look, wait,

32
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:01,204
I can't pay you anything for now.

33
00:02:01,287 --> 00:02:02,497
But hear me out.

34
00:02:03,164 --> 00:02:05,792
I'll do anything you want.

35
00:02:08,628 --> 00:02:11,131
It's not like that, but--

36
00:02:11,214 --> 00:02:12,006
Hello?

37
00:02:12,674 --> 00:02:13,424
Hello?

38
00:02:15,218 --> 00:02:16,052
[screams in anger]

39
00:02:37,157 --> 00:02:40,160
[tense music playing]

40
00:02:55,717 --> 00:02:56,718
Jaguar?

41
00:03:03,224 --> 00:03:04,183
[exhales sharply]

42
00:03:09,522 --> 00:03:10,523
How stubborn.

43
00:03:12,275 --> 00:03:14,652
I already told you,
you won't get any help from us.

44
00:03:14,736 --> 00:03:15,904
What are you doing here?

45
00:03:17,196 --> 00:03:18,615
If I had someone else to turn to,

46
00:03:18,698 --> 00:03:20,450
you wouldn't see me here.

47
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:22,577
-Now, where's your boss?
-[clicks tongue]

48
00:03:22,827 --> 00:03:23,870
Let me guess.

49
00:03:24,913 --> 00:03:26,456
You need Jaguar's help, don't you?

50
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:31,169
[goon] Why do you all
let Lily Cruz walk all over you?

51
00:03:31,961 --> 00:03:34,339
You'll do anything just to save her.

52
00:03:34,964 --> 00:03:37,133
How do you know why I came here?

53
00:03:38,051 --> 00:03:40,220
Do you know something
I don't? Spit it out.

54
00:03:40,970 --> 00:03:41,888
Madrigal…

55
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:44,557
We're the only ones you can go to now.

56
00:03:44,933 --> 00:03:46,184
Unfortunately for you…

57
00:03:47,685 --> 00:03:49,354
we just broke away from Jaguar.

58
00:03:51,689 --> 00:03:52,482
[scoffs]

59
00:03:54,067 --> 00:03:55,485
Then, I don't need you anymore.

60
00:03:57,779 --> 00:03:58,780
Madrigal.

61
00:04:00,531 --> 00:04:02,408
Why are you in a hurry?

62
00:04:02,742 --> 00:04:05,036
Why don't we have a little chat first?

63
00:04:06,037 --> 00:04:07,497
Didn't you hear what I said?

64
00:04:09,916 --> 00:04:10,959
I said…

65
00:04:13,127 --> 00:04:14,254
I don't need you anymore.

66
00:04:18,466 --> 00:04:19,425
[grunts]

67
00:04:26,266 --> 00:04:27,058
Hey!

68
00:04:35,775 --> 00:04:37,026
-Back off!
-Hold him!

69
00:04:37,443 --> 00:04:39,362
-Hold him down!
-Let go of me!

70
00:04:41,906 --> 00:04:43,074
[grunts]

71
00:05:30,455 --> 00:05:31,664
-Here you go.
-Take a break.

72
00:05:31,748 --> 00:05:32,540
Thanks, Boss.

73
00:05:32,623 --> 00:05:33,916
-I got this.
-Okay.

74
00:05:34,292 --> 00:05:35,043
Go.

75
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:39,380
The boss said we should take a break.

76
00:05:39,464 --> 00:05:41,090
-Really?
-I think he's up to something.

77
00:05:41,174 --> 00:05:42,383
-Let's go.
-Nice.

78
00:05:50,183 --> 00:05:51,350
Don't come near me.

79
00:05:53,478 --> 00:05:54,228
Come on.

80
00:05:54,312 --> 00:05:55,938
I just brought you food.

81
00:05:56,272 --> 00:05:58,316
-You should eat.
-I don't want to.

82
00:05:58,399 --> 00:05:59,609
I'm not hungry.

83
00:06:01,402 --> 00:06:02,737
You might get weak.

84
00:06:07,158 --> 00:06:08,367
Sorry about earlier.

85
00:06:09,702 --> 00:06:10,995
The Governor told me…

86
00:06:11,704 --> 00:06:13,039
to do whatever I wanted.

87
00:06:14,207 --> 00:06:15,083
The truth is…

88
00:06:15,166 --> 00:06:17,502
I don't like taking advantage
of helpless women.

89
00:06:19,545 --> 00:06:20,838
I like them feisty.

90
00:06:21,672 --> 00:06:24,634
[screaming] Stop it! Let go of me!

91
00:06:25,093 --> 00:06:25,927
Stop!

92
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:27,595
So, you're telling me…

93
00:06:28,054 --> 00:06:30,223
that your mother can fight too?

94
00:06:31,182 --> 00:06:32,683
[Julio] Is that it?

95
00:06:33,142 --> 00:06:34,185
Well, listen closely.

96
00:06:35,061 --> 00:06:36,062
Right now…

97
00:06:37,355 --> 00:06:41,567
my henchman's pulling down
his pants zipper.

98
00:06:42,527 --> 00:06:46,781
Because he's going to rape your mother!

99
00:06:48,866 --> 00:06:50,576
[Camia screams]

100
00:06:50,660 --> 00:06:52,286
No! Stop it!

101
00:06:52,370 --> 00:06:56,124
-[in low voice] You monster!
-So, even if Damian wins,

102
00:06:56,457 --> 00:06:57,834
your mother…

103
00:06:58,334 --> 00:07:02,380
is just going to be a shell of herself.

104
00:07:03,005 --> 00:07:04,382
[Camia screaming] Let go of me!

105
00:07:05,049 --> 00:07:06,843
[Julio] <i>My henchman will make Camia relive</i>

106
00:07:06,926 --> 00:07:09,011
<i>her worst nightmare…</i>

107
00:07:10,012 --> 00:07:11,931
[Camia sobbing]

108
00:07:13,516 --> 00:07:16,144
…with one change

109
00:07:16,227 --> 00:07:17,812
to what happened in the past.

110
00:07:17,895 --> 00:07:19,105
You bastard!

111
00:07:20,148 --> 00:07:23,067
-Bastard--
-This time, that worthless Raul

112
00:07:23,151 --> 00:07:25,069
won't come to save your mother

113
00:07:25,153 --> 00:07:28,114
to dig her out of her grave!

114
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:31,325
-You demon!
-Don't worry, don't worry!

115
00:07:31,409 --> 00:07:33,077
It's going to happen.

116
00:07:33,703 --> 00:07:37,748
Because I've got everything figured out.

117
00:07:38,249 --> 00:07:39,917
And I want you to remember that.

118
00:07:40,835 --> 00:07:42,211
[Julio] I want it ingrained in your mind.

119
00:07:42,295 --> 00:07:44,630
Because I want you to feel…

120
00:07:44,714 --> 00:07:47,592
every bit of pain.

121
00:07:48,050 --> 00:07:51,762
I want you to witness it yourself!

122
00:07:51,846 --> 00:07:53,639
Julio, you damn monster!

123
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:55,224
You're a monster!

124
00:07:56,851 --> 00:07:58,227
When I get out of here,

125
00:07:58,311 --> 00:08:00,897
I swear I'll kill you, you bastard!

126
00:08:01,731 --> 00:08:02,732
Look at you.

127
00:08:02,815 --> 00:08:04,192
What are you talking about?

128
00:08:04,650 --> 00:08:06,027
[Julio laughs viciously]

129
00:08:06,611 --> 00:08:07,695
It's show time!

130
00:08:10,865 --> 00:08:12,533
[crying] You monster!

131
00:08:12,617 --> 00:08:14,327
Mom…

132
00:08:14,410 --> 00:08:15,995
Julio, you monster!

133
00:08:16,078 --> 00:08:18,164
You bastard!

134
00:08:18,247 --> 00:08:19,457
Mom!

135
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:20,791
[Lily sobbing]

136
00:08:21,626 --> 00:08:22,585
Well…

137
00:08:24,212 --> 00:08:25,546
It was nice…

138
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:27,882
talking with you,

139
00:08:27,965 --> 00:08:28,841
Lily Cruz.

140
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,677
It was nice hearing your…

141
00:08:32,386 --> 00:08:35,848
empty threats and your…

142
00:08:36,641 --> 00:08:39,101
your silly promises.

143
00:08:39,185 --> 00:08:40,728
[laughs viciously]

144
00:08:41,479 --> 00:08:42,522
Come on!

145
00:08:43,105 --> 00:08:44,398
Admit it.

146
00:08:44,482 --> 00:08:47,485
You knew this was going to happen.

147
00:08:48,110 --> 00:08:50,279
-You haven't won!
-What--

148
00:08:50,363 --> 00:08:53,950
When I get out of here,
I swear I'm going to kill you!

149
00:08:54,033 --> 00:08:58,246
And I'll start with your family!

150
00:08:58,663 --> 00:09:01,541
What you're doing to me
and my family now?!

151
00:09:01,624 --> 00:09:03,459
I'll give it back worse!

152
00:09:03,543 --> 00:09:06,712
Blah, blah, blah!

153
00:09:08,172 --> 00:09:09,340
What's wrong with you?

154
00:09:10,132 --> 00:09:11,842
You know, we're no different
from each other.

155
00:09:11,926 --> 00:09:15,221
We come from the same cut of cloth!

156
00:09:16,264 --> 00:09:19,225
You act like you're so noble

157
00:09:20,393 --> 00:09:22,186
when truth of the matter is,

158
00:09:22,770 --> 00:09:26,107
you're nothing but just another egotistic,

159
00:09:26,857 --> 00:09:29,026
power-hungry little witch

160
00:09:29,110 --> 00:09:31,946
who wants to rule over this town.

161
00:09:32,446 --> 00:09:34,323
And you don't mind you're going to do it

162
00:09:34,407 --> 00:09:39,412
even at the expense of the ones you love!

163
00:09:39,495 --> 00:09:41,038
You're filth!

164
00:09:41,831 --> 00:09:44,083
You, of all people?!
Look in a mirror, Julio!

165
00:09:44,166 --> 00:09:47,169
Are you seriously projecting
your screwed-up morals on me?!

166
00:09:47,253 --> 00:09:48,671
Like we're the same?

167
00:09:48,754 --> 00:09:51,048
You're trash! You senile old man!

168
00:09:51,132 --> 00:09:52,550
That is why…

169
00:09:53,259 --> 00:09:54,802
Demons always win!

170
00:09:54,885 --> 00:09:55,886
[Lily] No!

171
00:09:56,262 --> 00:09:57,930
Good always wins!

172
00:09:58,848 --> 00:10:01,100
Mark my words, Julio Ardiente!

173
00:10:01,183 --> 00:10:03,936
I swear on this spot…

174
00:10:04,437 --> 00:10:07,315
where innocent blood was spilled…

175
00:10:07,398 --> 00:10:10,860
including my father's, Nanny Carlotta's,

176
00:10:10,943 --> 00:10:13,029
Miss Loring's, and Mr. Pandoy's.

177
00:10:13,446 --> 00:10:16,032
I swear on all of them.

178
00:10:16,490 --> 00:10:18,659
No more blood will be shed.

179
00:10:18,743 --> 00:10:20,536
Not one innocent shall die again!

180
00:10:22,246 --> 00:10:24,624
I will end you,

181
00:10:24,707 --> 00:10:26,042
Julio Ardiente!

182
00:10:27,752 --> 00:10:30,630
You and your family will perish!

183
00:10:31,213 --> 00:10:32,840
But, before that,

184
00:10:33,341 --> 00:10:36,552
you'll all beg for mercy!

185
00:10:36,969 --> 00:10:38,429
Your souls themselves

186
00:10:38,512 --> 00:10:40,931
will beg for my mercy!

187
00:10:46,062 --> 00:10:48,898
[action music playing]

188
00:11:02,203 --> 00:11:04,455
[screaming]

189
00:11:22,932 --> 00:11:24,850
[timer beeping]

190
00:11:27,561 --> 00:11:28,562
[Damian] Come on.

191
00:11:37,863 --> 00:11:38,823
Put it on.

192
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:43,786
[Julio] Wow!

193
00:11:45,204 --> 00:11:46,997
How nice.

194
00:11:47,581 --> 00:11:48,457
Sit!

195
00:11:48,999 --> 00:11:51,001
It's nice, your new collar.

196
00:11:57,633 --> 00:11:58,551
[grunts]

197
00:12:12,231 --> 00:12:13,691
[ragged breathing]

198
00:12:21,699 --> 00:12:23,909
Maybe I should change your name

199
00:12:24,577 --> 00:12:26,120
from Lily to…

200
00:12:27,121 --> 00:12:28,164
Fifi?

201
00:12:28,247 --> 00:12:29,415
[laughs viciously]

202
00:12:29,498 --> 00:12:31,542
[in silly voice] A cute little dog! Fifi!

203
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:35,963
-And this…
-Damn you!

204
00:12:36,046 --> 00:12:38,257
And this will make you shut up!

205
00:12:38,340 --> 00:12:41,218
-[electric shocks]
-[Lily gasps]

206
00:12:42,136 --> 00:12:43,846
[Julio] Surprise, surprise, surprise!

207
00:12:44,513 --> 00:12:47,308
Learn to follow your master.

208
00:12:48,434 --> 00:12:49,477
Damn you…

209
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:53,063
Sit. Stay. Roll over.

210
00:12:53,147 --> 00:12:54,982
[laughs viciously]

211
00:12:55,065 --> 00:12:56,901
I'll get back at you, you bastard.

212
00:12:58,277 --> 00:12:59,320
My God.

213
00:13:00,070 --> 00:13:01,322
She never gives up!

214
00:13:02,114 --> 00:13:03,199
And I'll get back to you.

215
00:13:03,282 --> 00:13:04,325
But, for now,

216
00:13:05,117 --> 00:13:06,202
I think I will leave.

217
00:13:06,702 --> 00:13:07,995
[Julio] It's hot here!

218
00:13:09,038 --> 00:13:10,414
Bye, Lily Cruz!

219
00:13:11,624 --> 00:13:13,584
Enjoy and watch the show!

220
00:13:15,669 --> 00:13:17,379
A lot of other things will happen!

221
00:13:17,463 --> 00:13:19,590
[Julio laughs viciously]

222
00:13:20,549 --> 00:13:21,926
Goodbye!

223
00:13:30,267 --> 00:13:32,186
[screams in anger]

224
00:13:33,270 --> 00:13:35,940
-[screaming]
-[sobbing]

225
00:13:39,777 --> 00:13:40,819
[Camia sobbing]

226
00:13:54,959 --> 00:13:58,045
Is this what you really want?

227
00:14:02,258 --> 00:14:03,592
You don't need to force me.

228
00:14:03,676 --> 00:14:04,969
I'll give you what you want.

229
00:14:08,889 --> 00:14:11,308
But since you brought food.
Can I eat first?

230
00:14:13,769 --> 00:14:14,728
Sure.

231
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:25,030
Can you untie me?

232
00:14:25,739 --> 00:14:27,491
My wrists hurt.

233
00:14:32,204 --> 00:14:33,163
I can't.

234
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:37,918
I'll just feed you.

235
00:14:38,586 --> 00:14:40,170
You might try to escape.

236
00:15:03,986 --> 00:15:04,987
[retches]

237
00:15:17,791 --> 00:15:18,542
[grunts]

238
00:15:37,478 --> 00:15:38,979
Hi, Madrigal, my love.

239
00:15:48,322 --> 00:15:50,157
[Natalie] I heard about what happened.

240
00:15:51,700 --> 00:15:53,410
Do you need me to help you stand up?

241
00:15:54,161 --> 00:15:55,287
I can do it myself.

242
00:15:56,372 --> 00:15:57,122
[grunts]

243
00:15:57,373 --> 00:15:59,416
Well, obviously, you can't help yourself

244
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:02,294
because someone has
black and blue eyes now.

245
00:16:02,378 --> 00:16:04,254
Your face is purple.

246
00:16:06,173 --> 00:16:08,509
Maybe, you need another person's help.

247
00:16:09,134 --> 00:16:11,637
I don't know.
Maybe Nurse Natalie, perhaps?

248
00:16:12,972 --> 00:16:13,722
Where am I?

249
00:16:14,598 --> 00:16:16,016
-Let me help you.
-Where am I?

250
00:16:18,185 --> 00:16:19,895
-Don't touch me.
-Stop being so difficult.

251
00:16:19,979 --> 00:16:21,188
[Jepoy] Don't touch me!

252
00:16:22,147 --> 00:16:23,315
-Madrigal--
-[Jepoy growls]

253
00:16:24,149 --> 00:16:26,026
-Don't touch me.
-Fine!

254
00:16:26,860 --> 00:16:28,278
If you don't need my help…

255
00:16:28,570 --> 00:16:30,572
Well, let's take a good look around.

256
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:33,200
There's no one else here to help you.

257
00:16:33,659 --> 00:16:36,245
I think you just have to accept the fact…

258
00:16:36,578 --> 00:16:37,913
that I'm all you've got.

259
00:16:38,789 --> 00:16:42,626
Why don't you wrap that head
of yours around this thought?

260
00:16:43,961 --> 00:16:44,712
[scoffs]

261
00:16:44,795 --> 00:16:45,546
You…

262
00:16:46,755 --> 00:16:47,798
have got…

263
00:16:48,549 --> 00:16:49,925
-me.
-[Jepoy scoffs]

264
00:16:56,098 --> 00:16:56,849
You know what?

265
00:17:01,145 --> 00:17:03,230
You're so full of yourself.

266
00:17:03,981 --> 00:17:05,983
I don't need your help.

267
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:10,029
And I will never ask for your help.

268
00:17:11,238 --> 00:17:12,031
Got that?

269
00:17:12,114 --> 00:17:13,949
-No.
-Leave me alone.

270
00:17:14,491 --> 00:17:17,453
-I can take care of myself.
-I don't understand.

271
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:20,748
I don't understand
what you're talking about.

272
00:17:21,123 --> 00:17:23,208
All I can remember…

273
00:17:23,292 --> 00:17:25,002
is that the last time…

274
00:17:26,086 --> 00:17:28,422
we had a chance to hang out,

275
00:17:29,631 --> 00:17:31,550
you were willing to throw away

276
00:17:31,633 --> 00:17:33,635
all you had with Anna…

277
00:17:34,887 --> 00:17:37,681
just to have one last taste of me.

278
00:17:38,682 --> 00:17:39,850
Do you remember?

279
00:17:39,933 --> 00:17:41,310
Watch your mouth.

280
00:17:42,811 --> 00:17:44,354
Whether you admit it or not

281
00:17:45,147 --> 00:17:48,734
and no matter how many times
you tell me that you love Anna,

282
00:17:49,651 --> 00:17:52,321
your blood craves for me.

283
00:17:53,238 --> 00:17:54,364
You want me…

284
00:17:54,448 --> 00:17:56,116
and you need me.

285
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:59,995
I have everything you need, Madrigal.

286
00:18:00,662 --> 00:18:01,747
I have power.

287
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:04,374
I have even more money now.

288
00:18:04,833 --> 00:18:06,168
I can take care of you.

289
00:18:07,419 --> 00:18:09,129
Everything you want…

290
00:18:09,671 --> 00:18:10,464
I have.

291
00:18:11,215 --> 00:18:12,841
And I'm willing to give it to you.

292
00:18:32,361 --> 00:18:35,364
[Helena] <i>You can't even</i>
<i>finish off your opponent!</i>

293
00:18:35,447 --> 00:18:37,741
<i>You couldn't kill up front.</i>

294
00:18:37,825 --> 00:18:40,160
<i>Because I don't get my hands dirty, Mama.</i>

295
00:18:40,244 --> 00:18:42,121
[Helena] <i>If you want to</i>
<i>succeed in business,</i>

296
00:18:42,204 --> 00:18:43,747
<i>you need to be hands-on.</i>

297
00:18:43,831 --> 00:18:44,873
<i>But don't worry.</i>

298
00:18:44,957 --> 00:18:47,668
<i>Pretty soon, you're going to get</i>
<i>the killer instinct like your son.</i>

299
00:18:47,751 --> 00:18:49,711
<i>But I do have a killer instinct, Mama.</i>

300
00:18:49,795 --> 00:18:50,963
<i>So prove it.</i>

301
00:19:11,233 --> 00:19:13,569
[laughs viciously]

302
00:19:14,736 --> 00:19:16,488
[laughs viciously]

303
00:19:17,865 --> 00:19:21,160
I think I'll be needing you…

304
00:19:21,535 --> 00:19:23,662
sooner than later.

305
00:19:31,753 --> 00:19:34,131
[laughs viciously]

306
00:19:34,756 --> 00:19:36,133
I love it!

307
00:19:48,270 --> 00:19:49,563
Let me take care of you.

308
00:19:50,230 --> 00:19:51,523
I don't love you.

309
00:19:52,065 --> 00:19:52,941
[scorns]

310
00:19:54,151 --> 00:19:56,486
[scoffs] Aren't you tired of saying that?

311
00:19:56,570 --> 00:19:57,613
[sighs heavily]

312
00:19:58,488 --> 00:19:59,781
I'm tired of hearing it.

313
00:20:01,950 --> 00:20:05,329
If you really want to help Lily Cruz,

314
00:20:06,079 --> 00:20:07,623
listen carefully, Madrigal.

315
00:20:09,249 --> 00:20:11,293
I inherited…

316
00:20:11,376 --> 00:20:14,504
one of the Big Four's armies.

317
00:20:16,590 --> 00:20:17,799
Plus…

318
00:20:19,218 --> 00:20:20,594
I inherited…

319
00:20:22,596 --> 00:20:24,765
fake Jaguar's men.

320
00:20:28,143 --> 00:20:28,936
Right?

321
00:20:31,730 --> 00:20:34,566
I can tell them to help you

322
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:36,985
if I wanted to.

323
00:20:38,779 --> 00:20:40,739
[Natalie] I could also ask them

324
00:20:40,822 --> 00:20:43,492
to beat the living crap out of you

325
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:46,578
when you're being dumb.

326
00:20:48,163 --> 00:20:50,874
Stop being so foolish, Madrigal.

327
00:20:53,210 --> 00:20:55,337
I can give you everything you need.

328
00:20:57,506 --> 00:20:59,508
I want to give you everything.

329
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:02,386
I can do…

330
00:21:03,637 --> 00:21:06,390
whatever it is you want me to do.

331
00:21:08,100 --> 00:21:09,184
And they'll listen.

332
00:21:10,727 --> 00:21:12,020
Because I

333
00:21:13,146 --> 00:21:13,939
am

334
00:21:15,482 --> 00:21:16,483
their

335
00:21:17,776 --> 00:21:18,652
queen.

336
00:21:39,339 --> 00:21:41,383
Emilia. How are you?

337
00:21:44,094 --> 00:21:46,471
To what do I owe this pleasure, Raul?

338
00:21:47,347 --> 00:21:48,890
Of course, I missed you.

339
00:21:49,391 --> 00:21:51,935
I missed being with you and your family.

340
00:21:52,019 --> 00:21:53,228
I missed Mama and Papa.

341
00:21:53,312 --> 00:21:56,023
So, do you mind if I come along?

342
00:21:56,106 --> 00:21:57,149
Oh my gosh, Raul.

343
00:21:57,232 --> 00:21:58,567
You're trying to sweet talk me

344
00:21:58,650 --> 00:22:00,402
because you want something from me.

345
00:22:01,278 --> 00:22:02,988
What are you talking about, Emilia?

346
00:22:03,488 --> 00:22:06,241
You found out that your
son, Diego, is missing.

347
00:22:06,325 --> 00:22:09,953
Now you think my family
has something to do with it.

348
00:22:10,037 --> 00:22:11,747
That's why you're trying to sweet talk me.

349
00:22:12,497 --> 00:22:13,415
Wait.

350
00:22:13,498 --> 00:22:15,542
What do you mean Diego's missing?

351
00:22:15,959 --> 00:22:17,544
What does Diego have to do with this?

352
00:22:17,627 --> 00:22:19,713
First, Lily goes missing. Now, Diego too?

353
00:22:19,796 --> 00:22:20,922
What are you talking about?

354
00:22:21,006 --> 00:22:22,424
-Goodbye, Raul.
-Hold on, we're not yet done.

355
00:22:22,507 --> 00:22:24,009
-Ow! Let me go!
-What have you done to Diego?

356
00:22:24,092 --> 00:22:25,093
Wait!

357
00:22:26,928 --> 00:22:28,764
Everyone has their secrets, Raul.

358
00:22:28,847 --> 00:22:29,931
Deal with it.

359
00:22:32,142 --> 00:22:33,310
-Get back here, Emilia!
-Let's go!

360
00:22:38,356 --> 00:22:39,149
Emilia!

361
00:22:40,025 --> 00:22:41,651
Emilia! I'll find out what you're hiding!

362
00:22:41,735 --> 00:22:43,278
Emilia, we aren't done yet!

363
00:22:48,992 --> 00:22:50,660
[panting]

364
00:22:58,919 --> 00:23:01,755
[ragged breathing]

365
00:23:15,685 --> 00:23:16,937
What are you doing?!

366
00:23:18,355 --> 00:23:20,565
I'm looking for the gun
that will kill you!

367
00:23:22,275 --> 00:23:24,236
You're out of your mind!

368
00:23:25,821 --> 00:23:27,948
Instead of yapping,

369
00:23:28,031 --> 00:23:31,034
why don't you look for the gun,
so you can save Lily?

370
00:23:46,508 --> 00:23:47,843
We'll just serve her food.

371
00:23:48,802 --> 00:23:49,636
Hand it to her.

372
00:23:51,138 --> 00:23:52,264
[man] Here, eat that.

373
00:23:55,183 --> 00:23:56,017
Eat up.

374
00:23:58,895 --> 00:24:00,272
How am I supposed to eat this?

375
00:24:01,606 --> 00:24:03,108
We won't give you utensils.

376
00:24:03,650 --> 00:24:04,651
[man] We can't take any chances.

377
00:24:05,152 --> 00:24:06,653
You're tougher than Catwoman,

378
00:24:06,987 --> 00:24:08,572
and you're more slippery than an eel.

379
00:24:08,655 --> 00:24:11,408
You might use the utensils to kill us.

380
00:24:11,491 --> 00:24:12,742
So, just eat with your hands!

381
00:24:14,077 --> 00:24:15,745
Well, I'm not a superhero.

382
00:24:15,829 --> 00:24:17,747
So, I won't be able to do that to you.

383
00:24:18,790 --> 00:24:20,375
You read too many comics.

384
00:24:21,334 --> 00:24:23,128
I'm already on death row,

385
00:24:23,628 --> 00:24:25,797
and this is the food you give me?!

386
00:24:26,089 --> 00:24:27,424
Still pretty smug, aren't you?

387
00:24:27,799 --> 00:24:28,758
You think you're on death row?

388
00:24:29,134 --> 00:24:30,177
Isn't it obvious?

389
00:24:31,678 --> 00:24:32,679
Eat up!

390
00:24:52,199 --> 00:24:55,202
[sinister music playing]

391
00:25:06,379 --> 00:25:07,172
[groans]

392
00:25:08,506 --> 00:25:10,550
-[Lily groans]
-What is it this time?

393
00:25:12,093 --> 00:25:13,887
-I don't feel so good.
-[man scoffs]

394
00:25:14,221 --> 00:25:16,765
I don't know if this food's gone bad…

395
00:25:17,724 --> 00:25:19,017
or if it's just really bad.

396
00:25:19,976 --> 00:25:21,228
I need to use the bathroom.

397
00:25:21,811 --> 00:25:22,562
Damn it.

398
00:25:24,606 --> 00:25:26,107
Did you hear me?

399
00:25:26,566 --> 00:25:28,235
I said I need to use the bathroom!

400
00:25:28,318 --> 00:25:30,237
Do you want me to go right here?!

401
00:25:30,654 --> 00:25:31,655
Fine!

402
00:25:32,447 --> 00:25:33,657
Untie her.

403
00:25:35,116 --> 00:25:36,409
[man] Get her plate too.

404
00:25:39,871 --> 00:25:40,705
Untie her.

405
00:25:41,289 --> 00:25:43,208
Don't try anything funny.

406
00:25:45,543 --> 00:25:47,254
Don't tell me you're still
going to use those.

407
00:25:49,130 --> 00:25:50,131
Fine.

408
00:25:52,342 --> 00:25:53,218
Help her.

409
00:25:59,015 --> 00:26:00,016
Don't try anything funny.

410
00:26:03,478 --> 00:26:05,313
-Hurry.
-Don't touch me!

411
00:26:06,356 --> 00:26:08,441
You know, I don't need any weapons.

412
00:26:08,525 --> 00:26:10,026
I can kill you if I want.

413
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:18,034
We're here.

414
00:26:18,118 --> 00:26:19,411
-Let go!
-I said we're here!

415
00:26:20,161 --> 00:26:21,538
There's your restroom!

416
00:26:21,913 --> 00:26:23,206
You have ten minutes.

417
00:26:23,665 --> 00:26:25,417
We can help you if you want.

418
00:26:25,500 --> 00:26:26,376
Go.

419
00:26:30,839 --> 00:26:32,173
Stop it!

420
00:26:33,591 --> 00:26:35,093
Cut it out, perverts!

421
00:26:36,136 --> 00:26:38,013
I can do it myself.

422
00:26:42,934 --> 00:26:43,977
[man] Well, go in.

423
00:26:47,772 --> 00:26:49,190
You've got ten minutes.

424
00:27:03,288 --> 00:27:06,791
[tense music playing]

425
00:27:30,815 --> 00:27:34,235
[tense music continues playing]

426
00:27:57,050 --> 00:27:58,426
You want to touch it?

427
00:28:02,305 --> 00:28:03,848
Go ahead. It's okay.

428
00:28:08,978 --> 00:28:10,021
Come on.

429
00:28:15,610 --> 00:28:19,614
[suspenseful music playing]

430
00:28:49,227 --> 00:28:50,478
Hey! [knocking on door]

431
00:28:50,979 --> 00:28:52,147
Five minutes left.

432
00:29:11,583 --> 00:29:14,586
[suspenseful music playing]

433
00:29:18,173 --> 00:29:18,965
[Camia screams]

434
00:29:19,674 --> 00:29:20,800
[grunts]

435
00:29:22,969 --> 00:29:25,555
[man howls in pain]

436
00:29:31,227 --> 00:29:34,022
[howling in pain]

437
00:29:39,819 --> 00:29:41,196
She got away!

438
00:29:41,279 --> 00:29:42,697
Get her!

439
00:30:03,802 --> 00:30:05,553
[screaming] Looking for this?!

440
00:30:11,434 --> 00:30:12,477
It's right here.

441
00:30:17,315 --> 00:30:18,858
Are you ready to die?!

442
00:30:19,818 --> 00:30:20,693
Huh?!

443
00:30:23,738 --> 00:30:26,157
[tense music playing]

444
00:30:26,825 --> 00:30:28,076
You win.

445
00:30:30,578 --> 00:30:31,621
Shoot.

446
00:30:34,082 --> 00:30:35,208
Kill me.

447
00:30:36,209 --> 00:30:38,044
Then kill Camia next.

448
00:30:39,671 --> 00:30:41,714
And you and Lily can flee.

449
00:30:46,511 --> 00:30:47,512
Shoot me.

450
00:30:49,430 --> 00:30:50,974
Come on. Shoot me!

451
00:30:54,310 --> 00:30:55,770
[in low voice] Pull the trigger.

452
00:30:58,690 --> 00:31:00,483
Kill me now! Come on!

453
00:31:00,900 --> 00:31:03,152
What are you waiting for?!

454
00:31:03,236 --> 00:31:04,487
Pull the trigger! Come on!

455
00:31:05,947 --> 00:31:06,990
Come on!

456
00:31:12,620 --> 00:31:13,621
Now!

457
00:31:15,582 --> 00:31:17,250
Do it! Do it!

458
00:31:18,585 --> 00:31:20,753
Shoot him! Come on, Diego!

459
00:31:20,837 --> 00:31:21,754
Shoot!

460
00:31:24,048 --> 00:31:25,091
Wait, Mama.

461
00:31:25,174 --> 00:31:27,135
Don't tell me you'll let Lily Cruz live?

462
00:31:27,218 --> 00:31:28,803
That's unacceptable!

463
00:31:28,887 --> 00:31:30,388
She's the root of our misery.

464
00:31:30,471 --> 00:31:32,098
And she's the reason
why you came back for me!

465
00:31:32,181 --> 00:31:34,017
We'll exact revenge on her, right?

466
00:31:34,100 --> 00:31:36,436
Then why are you just
standing there, Mama?

467
00:31:36,519 --> 00:31:38,771
And making her come out
alive in this hell?

468
00:31:38,855 --> 00:31:40,398
No, no, no, Grandma.

469
00:31:40,481 --> 00:31:41,566
Don't listen to her.

470
00:31:41,649 --> 00:31:43,568
-Oh, come on, Arnaldo!
-Let Diego win this round.

471
00:31:43,651 --> 00:31:45,612
[scoffs] You're just saying that

472
00:31:45,695 --> 00:31:47,530
because you still have
feelings for Lily Cruz!

473
00:31:47,614 --> 00:31:51,159
That's why you want Diego
to shoot Damian, so that Lily can--

474
00:31:51,242 --> 00:31:53,953
-You know damn well that's not the reason!
-Enough!

475
00:31:55,246 --> 00:31:56,831
This is a game.

476
00:31:57,415 --> 00:31:59,167
And it isn't over yet.

477
00:32:00,627 --> 00:32:02,629
I promise you, when this is all over,

478
00:32:03,796 --> 00:32:09,594
everything will go back to the
way it should always be.

479
00:32:09,677 --> 00:32:10,970
So, carry on.

480
00:32:34,202 --> 00:32:35,745
Your time's up!

481
00:32:36,663 --> 00:32:37,413
[man] Hey!

482
00:32:39,207 --> 00:32:40,249
Come out!

483
00:32:42,251 --> 00:32:43,086
One!

484
00:32:45,964 --> 00:32:47,340
I said come out!

485
00:33:03,773 --> 00:33:04,607
Shoot me.

486
00:33:05,817 --> 00:33:06,859
Shoot me!

487
00:33:12,573 --> 00:33:13,616
[man screams]

488
00:33:15,159 --> 00:33:16,035
[man 2] Boss!

489
00:33:16,703 --> 00:33:18,538
Go after Camia Cruz! Hurry!

490
00:33:19,455 --> 00:33:20,373
Now!

491
00:33:30,466 --> 00:33:31,968
-Hurry up!
-No.

492
00:33:34,846 --> 00:33:36,472
Took you long enough in there.

493
00:33:41,769 --> 00:33:43,062
-You're so slow!
-Hey!

494
00:33:45,648 --> 00:33:46,691
Get moving!

495
00:33:47,567 --> 00:33:49,610
-Move it!
-Don't push me!

496
00:33:49,694 --> 00:33:50,570
Sit down!

497
00:33:53,156 --> 00:33:53,948
[man] What's this?

498
00:33:54,323 --> 00:33:55,324
You sneaky rat!

499
00:34:04,834 --> 00:34:06,419
Trying to pull something off, huh?

500
00:34:06,502 --> 00:34:07,587
Put this on the record!

501
00:34:10,256 --> 00:34:11,257
My pencil's gone!

502
00:34:13,426 --> 00:34:14,635
It's missing?

503
00:34:17,638 --> 00:34:18,556
Borrow mine!

504
00:34:20,892 --> 00:34:21,893
[grunts]

505
00:34:30,818 --> 00:34:32,028
[grunts]

506
00:34:33,780 --> 00:34:35,490
[gunshot]

507
00:34:54,092 --> 00:34:55,676
[grunts]

508
00:35:00,807 --> 00:35:04,185
[tense music playing]

509
00:35:15,488 --> 00:35:16,823
Where is she? Hey, wake up!

510
00:35:33,798 --> 00:35:34,757
Wake up!

511
00:35:35,049 --> 00:35:37,301
Come on! We need to find her! Get up!

512
00:35:49,856 --> 00:35:50,898
Get up!

513
00:35:51,524 --> 00:35:52,608
Move it!

514
00:36:05,788 --> 00:36:07,290
[Helena] It's crunch time!

515
00:36:07,957 --> 00:36:10,084
So, you have to kill
whoever you have to kill…

516
00:36:10,168 --> 00:36:12,128
in order to survive!

517
00:36:34,609 --> 00:36:35,401
What?

518
00:36:36,360 --> 00:36:38,738
What?! Camia got away?!

519
00:36:38,821 --> 00:36:39,572
[Emilia] What?!

520
00:36:45,995 --> 00:36:48,998
[suspenseful music playing]

521
00:37:07,975 --> 00:37:09,727
Lily Cruz is getting away!

522
00:37:10,061 --> 00:37:12,063
-[Helena growls]
-[Emilia screams]

523
00:37:41,133 --> 00:37:42,009
Lily?

524
00:37:47,807 --> 00:37:48,891
Where are you going?!

525
00:37:55,064 --> 00:37:56,274
You witch!

526
00:37:58,943 --> 00:38:00,695
I won't let you escape again!

527
00:38:05,616 --> 00:38:06,659
Mama, enough!

528
00:38:06,742 --> 00:38:08,119
-Enough, Mama!
-Helena!

529
00:38:08,202 --> 00:38:09,578
-Helena!
-How did this happen?!

530
00:38:09,662 --> 00:38:12,164
[Julio] Helena, relax!

531
00:38:12,415 --> 00:38:14,583
Hold your horses!

532
00:38:15,376 --> 00:38:17,503
Here comes the savior!

533
00:38:17,795 --> 00:38:19,839
[laughs viciously]

534
00:38:19,922 --> 00:38:21,090
How can you still laugh?!

535
00:38:21,173 --> 00:38:24,010
[Helena] Can't you see that Lily
Cruz is getting away?!

536
00:38:25,428 --> 00:38:29,223
That is why I will always be
better than you are, my dear.

537
00:38:29,307 --> 00:38:31,100
[Julio] Now, relax!

538
00:38:31,767 --> 00:38:32,685
Take a deep breath.

539
00:38:32,768 --> 00:38:35,062
Inhale, exhale.

540
00:38:35,146 --> 00:38:36,147
Do the same.

541
00:38:37,523 --> 00:38:39,275
And watch what happens.

542
00:38:40,693 --> 00:38:43,654
Watch as I command Lily Cruz…

543
00:38:44,280 --> 00:38:45,990
to lay down!

544
00:38:46,073 --> 00:38:48,409
[electric zaps]

545
00:38:48,492 --> 00:38:53,831
[laughing viciously]

546
00:38:53,914 --> 00:38:56,208
[electric zaps]

547
00:39:00,129 --> 00:39:01,839
See? Told you!

548
00:39:01,922 --> 00:39:03,549
She follows! She's very good!

549
00:39:04,091 --> 00:39:05,009
One more time!

550
00:39:05,092 --> 00:39:07,720
-[electric zaps]
-[Lily gasps]

551
00:39:07,803 --> 00:39:10,264
[Ardientes laughing viciously]

552
00:39:10,348 --> 00:39:12,725
[Emilia] This is fantastic, Papa!

553
00:39:12,808 --> 00:39:16,187
I told you I had everything under control.

554
00:39:16,270 --> 00:39:17,271
[Emilia laughs viciously]

555
00:39:17,355 --> 00:39:19,065
-Can you do it again?
-Do it again?

556
00:39:19,148 --> 00:39:21,984
By the request of my grandson…

557
00:39:22,443 --> 00:39:23,652
Lie down! [laughs]

558
00:39:23,736 --> 00:39:28,866
-[laughing viciously]
-[electric zaps]

559
00:39:28,949 --> 00:39:31,869
[Julio] Stay! [laughs viciously]

560
00:39:31,952 --> 00:39:38,459
-[laughing viciously]
-[electric zaps]

561
00:39:38,542 --> 00:39:41,295
[electric zaps]

562
00:39:41,379 --> 00:39:43,672
-[laughing viciously]
-[electric zaps]

563
00:39:43,756 --> 00:39:44,673
[Julio] Sit! [laughs viciously]

564
00:39:44,757 --> 00:39:48,260
-[laughing viciously]
-[electric zaps]

565
00:39:49,720 --> 00:39:52,098
[inaudible]

566
00:39:52,181 --> 00:40:00,022
[electric zapping]

567
00:40:03,109 --> 00:40:05,403
[Fernan] We saw some
trucks pass by earlier.

568
00:40:05,945 --> 00:40:07,655
It looked like they were
carrying the Ardientes' men.

569
00:40:08,364 --> 00:40:09,824
Where were they headed?

570
00:40:10,157 --> 00:40:13,160
I think they were heading
to the heart of the forest.

571
00:40:15,538 --> 00:40:16,997
Mister Fernan, everyone…

572
00:40:17,373 --> 00:40:19,667
We have no one else
to rely on, but each other.

573
00:40:19,750 --> 00:40:21,544
If anyone has doubts

574
00:40:21,627 --> 00:40:23,879
about rescuing Auntie Camia and Lily,

575
00:40:24,171 --> 00:40:25,214
you can stay behind.

576
00:40:26,424 --> 00:40:28,843
-We're going.
-We're going with you.

577
00:40:28,926 --> 00:40:31,095
-We're going.
-Very well, let's go.

578
00:40:31,178 --> 00:40:32,596
-Let's go.
-Let's go, everyone!

579
00:40:33,889 --> 00:40:34,932
Hold on, Anna.

580
00:40:35,433 --> 00:40:36,809
Are you sure about this?

581
00:40:37,268 --> 00:40:38,144
This could be dangerous!

582
00:40:38,644 --> 00:40:41,063
Marlon, if I don't do this then who will?

583
00:40:41,689 --> 00:40:42,731
I knew it.

584
00:40:43,107 --> 00:40:44,608
Jepoy influenced you to do this.

585
00:40:44,692 --> 00:40:46,360
Jepoy has nothing to do with this!

586
00:40:46,444 --> 00:40:48,320
This is for Lily and Auntie Camia.

587
00:40:49,321 --> 00:40:51,157
Will you listen to yourself, Marlon?

588
00:40:55,411 --> 00:40:57,288
ANNA AND THE MEMBERS
OF THE COOPERATIVE

589
00:40:57,371 --> 00:40:59,665
ARE LOOKING FOR LILY.

590
00:41:01,167 --> 00:41:02,334
We still need more information.

591
00:41:02,418 --> 00:41:03,961
We can't just move without a plan.

592
00:41:05,171 --> 00:41:06,797
If you don't want to help,

593
00:41:06,881 --> 00:41:08,007
then stay here!

594
00:41:12,344 --> 00:41:13,179
[Anna] Come on.

595
00:41:24,148 --> 00:41:25,316
[Julio] You know…

596
00:41:27,234 --> 00:41:29,862
I like my steak rare.

597
00:41:30,279 --> 00:41:32,531
I mean, very rare.

598
00:41:33,282 --> 00:41:34,158
Because it…

599
00:41:34,241 --> 00:41:37,369
basically reminds me
of how cruel the animal…

600
00:41:37,453 --> 00:41:38,454
-was handled…
-[Helena laughs]

601
00:41:38,537 --> 00:41:39,955
…before it was served.

602
00:41:41,290 --> 00:41:42,082
Well…

603
00:41:42,875 --> 00:41:44,585
it makes a lot of difference.

604
00:41:45,377 --> 00:41:46,504
You're right.

605
00:41:46,795 --> 00:41:47,671
But, then again,

606
00:41:48,339 --> 00:41:49,757
I would be a lot happier

607
00:41:49,840 --> 00:41:52,051
if we were devouring Lily Cruz

608
00:41:52,134 --> 00:41:55,721
and her mother's flesh instead.

609
00:41:56,430 --> 00:41:57,848
My dear…

610
00:41:57,932 --> 00:42:00,017
I will never let you down.

611
00:42:02,811 --> 00:42:03,687
You know what?

612
00:42:05,147 --> 00:42:08,359
That electronic dog
collar? That was brilliant!

613
00:42:09,818 --> 00:42:11,737
But then, you were a little too sadistic.

614
00:42:12,029 --> 00:42:14,740
You allowed me to panic
before you pushed that button!

615
00:42:15,241 --> 00:42:16,534
Of course!

616
00:42:16,909 --> 00:42:17,952
Where's the fun in it?

617
00:42:18,035 --> 00:42:21,330
A little suspense won't hurt, right?

618
00:42:21,413 --> 00:42:22,623
And, you must admit…

619
00:42:23,374 --> 00:42:25,251
my men moved fast…

620
00:42:25,834 --> 00:42:28,587
fast enough to kill Camia's
fantasy of escaping.

621
00:42:34,009 --> 00:42:34,927
You know what?

622
00:42:35,010 --> 00:42:38,222
As much as I hate you
to the very core of my being,

623
00:42:38,305 --> 00:42:39,098
Ouch!

624
00:42:39,181 --> 00:42:40,182
I must say…

625
00:42:41,267 --> 00:42:42,142
you are…

626
00:42:42,685 --> 00:42:43,978
the perfect partner.

627
00:42:44,520 --> 00:42:45,521
[laughs]

628
00:42:46,146 --> 00:42:47,189
No, my dear.

629
00:42:48,524 --> 00:42:49,775
You are…

630
00:42:50,901 --> 00:42:52,069
my…

631
00:42:52,152 --> 00:42:53,988
perfect partner.

632
00:42:56,073 --> 00:42:57,157
Let me help you.

633
00:43:10,421 --> 00:43:12,131
Let's go kill our babies!

634
00:43:24,602 --> 00:43:26,270
Damn, Helena!

635
00:44:06,226 --> 00:44:07,728
What am I doing here?!

636
00:44:09,730 --> 00:44:12,733
Will you let me out of here?!

637
00:44:16,862 --> 00:44:18,113
Hey!

638
00:44:18,197 --> 00:44:21,116
-[slams door]
-I said, let me out of here!

639
00:44:24,328 --> 00:44:26,580
[Camia on video recording] <i>You monsters!</i>

640
00:44:29,750 --> 00:44:32,044
<i>What are you going to do to me?!</i>

641
00:44:32,127 --> 00:44:33,170
Mom!

642
00:44:34,463 --> 00:44:35,839
[Camia on video recording] <i>You monsters!</i>

643
00:44:36,507 --> 00:44:38,008
[Camia] You monsters!

644
00:44:38,092 --> 00:44:39,843
Where's my daughter?!

645
00:44:40,511 --> 00:44:42,554
You bastards! What are you
doing to my mother?!

646
00:44:43,889 --> 00:44:44,765
Mom!

647
00:44:45,224 --> 00:44:47,101
[Camia on video recording] <i>You monsters!</i>

648
00:44:48,185 --> 00:44:49,019
[Camia wails]

649
00:44:51,605 --> 00:44:54,274
[Camia] Let Lily go!

650
00:44:54,358 --> 00:44:56,360
You bastards!

651
00:44:57,236 --> 00:44:59,321
[sobbing] You monsters!

652
00:45:00,322 --> 00:45:01,782
Lily!

653
00:45:04,243 --> 00:45:05,869
Mom!

654
00:45:11,417 --> 00:45:15,546
[Julio] <i>We'll drive her insane,</i>
<i>as she did my grandson.</i>

655
00:45:15,629 --> 00:45:16,713
<i>Not so tough now, are we?</i>

656
00:45:17,464 --> 00:45:18,799
<i>Why don't you come closer?</i>

657
00:45:18,882 --> 00:45:20,342
[grunting]

658
00:45:22,010 --> 00:45:24,596
[Diego] <i>Listen to me.</i>
<i>We don't have to kill each other.</i>

659
00:45:24,680 --> 00:45:26,932
<i>We can save Auntie Camia and Lily</i>

660
00:45:27,015 --> 00:45:28,434
<i>if you cooperate with me.</i>

661
00:45:28,517 --> 00:45:29,893
<i>We're going to turn the tables on them.</i>

662
00:45:29,977 --> 00:45:31,228
[gunshot]

663
00:45:31,311 --> 00:45:33,272
[Lily] <i>Show yourselves!</i>

664
00:45:33,355 --> 00:45:34,773
<i>Come out and face me!</i>

665
00:45:34,857 --> 00:45:36,442
<i>Don't be cowards!</i>

666
00:45:36,525 --> 00:45:39,736
<i>Come and get me, Ardientes!</i>

667
00:45:39,820 --> 00:45:41,280
<i>Where's my mother?!</i>

668
00:45:41,363 --> 00:45:44,408
-[gunshots]
-[Lily screams]

669
00:45:44,491 --> 00:45:47,161
[theme music playing]
